    "en": {
      "trackName": "Wrist Leisure",
      "description": "This is a pixel-style casual entertainment app for Apple Watch. Use light interactions to unwind in a busy moment, or to pass a little time during the day. It includes puzzles, board and card activities, everyday scenes, stories, and simple interactions you can start by raising your wrist. The interface is clean and opens as soon as you raise your wrist. On a paired iPhone, you can check your progress and use the virtual balance and companion features.",
      "releaseNotes": "• Full notebook sketch restyle (ruled paper, hand-drawn icons)\n• More consistent look & feel across iPhone and Apple Watch\n• Shop, Settings, Feedback and more redrawn in sketch style\n• Stability improvements and bug fixes",
