    {
      "version": "1.0.2",
      "releaseNotes": "• New games\nCoffee Master — grind, steam, and pour on your wrist café bar\nOne Tea — pour, time, and taste the tea rhythm\nPlot Grow — plant and water a tiny farm on your watch\nMouth Toss — aim and toss food right into the mouth\nSpit Aim — time your spit and hit the target\n• New languages\nNow supports Simplified Chinese, English, Traditional Chinese, Spanish, Arabic, Russian, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, Italian, Bengali, Turkish, and Hindi. Switch anytime in Settings.",
      "seenAt": "2026-07-31T08:55:55Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.3",
      "releaseNotes": "Four new games\n• Slice Master: Cut produce close to the ordered weight\n• Face Vent: Tap to vent—combos stack the faces\n• Traveler: Wrist pet goes on trips; care syncs phone ↔ Watch\n• Fever Spin: Place a bet and pull the lever",
      "seenAt": "2026-08-03T04:55:05Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.4",
      "releaseNotes": "• New Mega Maze: huge map, fog of war, virtual joystick, and full-map preview\n• Traveler on iPhone: cleaner layout and improved room/scene display\n• Game Center: friend leaderboards for supported games\n• Fixes for display and stability",
      "seenAt": "2026-08-13T01:20:46Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.5",
      "releaseNotes": "Four new Watch card games in this update:\n• Watch Dou Dizhu: three-player play—bid Landlord, play or pass; bombs/rockets can multiply\n• Watch President: four-player shedding—empty your hand first to become President\n• Watch Big Two: popular SE Asia shedding—player with a 3 leads; same count + higher rank to beat; 2 is highest\n• Watch Mahjong: four-player draw play with self-draw & discard wins; Chi/Pong/Kong on one button\n• Fixes and quality improvements",
      "seenAt": "2026-08-15T18:26:25Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.6",
      "releaseNotes": "• New “Rate Watch Games” in Settings—opens the App Store write-review page directly\n• Small polish and copy updates",
      "seenAt": "2026-08-17T18:47:14Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.7",
      "releaseNotes": "Shop & Coins\n\nNew Shop in Settings: spend coins on marbles and card-table chips\nEarn coins by beating personal-best score milestones in any game\nCoin-earning guide and spending history in the Shop\nCard Stakes\n\nBig Two, Dou Dizhu, President, Mahjong: choose a chip stake before each hand\nFever Spin uses the shared chip balance for bets\nQuitting mid-hand forfeits your stake; re-enter to place a new bet\nPolish\n\nMarble tips updated: buy marbles with coins in Settings → Shop\nEndless games now show Mode ∞ instead of Clears / Wins",
      "seenAt": "2026-08-26T22:17:05Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.8",
      "releaseNotes": "• Home: switch between Default and Newest sorting; pin multiple games so they stay on top; first-launch tip for pinning\n• Pool: unlock and equip table, cue, and aim styles with coins in the Shop\n• Fever Spin: clearer layout and controls; open the Shop when you need more chips\n• Broader localization for Outdoor Traveler and other games\n• Stability and UI polish\n\nThanks for playing. Feedback is always welcome.",
      "seenAt": "2026-09-02T07:19:59Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.9",
      "releaseNotes": "• Auction Time: morning, hot, mystery, and street sessions. Listings may hide cracks or fakes—spend auction coins to scratch or appraise before you bid. Sell lots or wait on the market. Add the Auction Market watch face widget, and optionally get a reminder before a session starts (Settings).\n• Peak Memory: watch the lit path, then slide it from memory. 15 levels with longer, twistier routes. A short hint after a few misses. You can reset level progress.\n• Twin Link: red tiles appear one by one; then connect the two green tiles on the outer ring without touching the reds. 15 levels. You can reset level progress.\n• Outdoor Traveler: refreshed shop gear art.\n• Stability and localization polish.\n\nThanks for playing. Feedback is always welcome.",
      "seenAt": "2026-09-03T04:59:46Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.10",
      "releaseNotes": "1. Fixed an issue some users reported that prevented entering the app—thank you for the feedback\n2. New game Bottle Forge: tap to flip bottles, charge to land, upgrade skills, buy better bottles, and hire away-hands\n3. Watch Marbles upgrades: clearer multiplier shields, auto-launch at full charge, and independent portals that vanish after use\n4. Fever Spin UI polish: results as toast alerts; bottom controls stay fully visible\n5. Small reliability and UX fixes",
      "seenAt": "2026-09-06T12:25:58Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.0.11",
      "releaseNotes": "1.Improved launch memory and stability on Apple Watch Series 6 / 7 / 8, SE (2nd generation), and Ultra (1st generation).\n2.Improved overall user experience with smoother interactions and clearer UI\n3.New folk-horror text adventure Haunted Village: branching choices and multiple endings (shown in Chinese locales)",
      "seenAt": "2026-09-07T13:44:41Z"
    },
    {
